      "recommendation": null,
      "kind": "rationale",
      "topic": "screening",
      "text": "Sepsis screening tools are designed to promote early identification of sepsis and consist of manual methods or automated use of the electronic health record (EHR). There is wide variation in diagnostic accuracy of these tools with most having poor predictive values, although the use of some was associated with improvements in care processes.",
